  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Studio Yafa Fas II 2022-2024</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Studio Yafa Phase II 2022-2024 - Studio Yafa Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen har som &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l att st&#xe4;rka beaktandet av behovet av social sammanh&#xe5;llning, fred och h&#xe5;llbar, inkluderande och r&#xe4;ttvis utveckling f&#xf6;r befolkningen, s&#xe4;rskilt ungdomar, kvinnor och internflyktingar, genom att producera och sprida information av h&#xf6;g kvalitet. 

Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let kommer att uppn&#xe5;s genom att arbeta f&#xf6;r att uppn&#xe5; f&#xf6;ljande resultat:
(1) Den burkinska befolkningen, s&#xe4;rskilt ungdomar, kvinnor och internflyktingar, &#xe4;r b&#xe4;ttre informerade och mer aktiva i demokratiska processer och utvecklingsprocesser genom informations- och dialogprogram och (2) den burkinab&#xe9;iska mediesektorn st&#xe4;rks, blir mer professionell och mer sj&#xe4;lvst&#xe4;ndig genom utbildning och tekniskt st&#xf6;d.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contributions overall objective is to strengthen the taking into account of the need for social cohesion, peace and sustainable, inclusive and equitable development of the population, especially youth, women and IDPs, through the production and dissemination of quality information. 
The overall objective will be attained by working towards the following outcomes :
(1) The Burkinab&#xe9; population, particularly youth, women and IDPs, are better informed and more active in democratic and development processes through information and dialogue programs and (2) The Burkinab&#xe9; media sector is strengthened, more professional and more autonoumous through training and technical support.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives, outcomes, indicators and targets have been revised throughout the project period 2022-2024 due to the changed context and changed funding circumstances:

OBJECTIVES AND OUTCOMES 2022-2023

The objective of Studio Yafa:

To contribute to the effective consideration of the social cohesion needs in peace, sustainable, inclusive and equitable development, and the citizenship of populations, especially the youth, women, and IDPs, through the production and dissemination of quality information.

Outcomes of Studio Yafa: 1) CSO&apos;s accountability actions on public policies are supported through the production and dissemination of quality content focused on the planning sectors of the national development framework (indicators for this outcome were limited from 2022), 2) The Burkinab&#xe8; population, especially youth, women and IDPs, is better informed and more active in democratic and development processes through information and dialogue programs, and 3) The Burkinabe media sector is strengthened and more professional and more autonomous through training and technical support. 

The objective of Faso Yafa (added in an amendment by Sida in December 2022):

To contribute to humanitarian assistance to save lives and restore the dignity of affected communities - in particular their most vulnerable members - in Burkina Faso within the framework of the triple nexus.

Specific outcome of Faso Yafa: Studio Yafa disseminates information useful for internally displaced people, in particular women, in relation to their situation and gives them a space to express themselves 

OBJECTIVE AND OUTCOMES 2022-2024

The(joint objective of Studio Yafa and Faso Yafa: 

To contribute to strengthening social cohesion and resilience of populations in the face of the crisis in Burkina Faso through relevant information and dialogue programmes, targeting women, youth and internally displaced persons (IDPs)

The revised outcomes were: 1) The Burkinab&#xe8; population, especially youth, women and IDPs, is better informed and more resilient in democratic and development processes through information and dialogue programs, and 2) The Burkinabe media sector is strengthened and more professional and moving towards empowerment through training and technical support.</narrative>
  </description>
